# NightLife preset
format = 1
name = Tawny Wood
author = NightLife
description = The two-note hoot, at the measured numbers: the owl group's phrases hold a median of two calls 2.85 Hz apart with 6.3 s between phrases, and its fundamental is 497 Hz with a single harmonic -- the purest voice in the library at a measured -34 dB of roughness. Motif drops the second note a tone and a half, which is what the tawny recordings do.

